flowchart TD
    S0((New Asset)) --> A["<b>AVAILABLE</b><br/>In stock & ready for allocation"]
    A <-->|Assign / Unassign| B["<b>ASSIGNED</b><br/>Bound to employee custodian"]
    A <-->|Fault / Repair| C["<b>MAINTENANCE</b><br/>Under active diagnostics"]
    B -->|Defect Reported| C
    A -->|End of Life| D["<b>RETIRED</b><br/>Decommissioned"]
    C -->|Unrepairable| D
    D --> S1(((Archived)))
